security-negative-proof=pass

Boundaries preserved:
- The proof target is an owned child Node process started by the harness.
- Timer expiry reuses the persisted action target and process id.
- Stale action id mismatch returns agent.command.rejected before adapter execution.
- Dry-run returns would-enforce/dry-run-no-action and does not terminate the owned process.
- Generated proof redacts the agent endpoint as loopback-redacted.
- The script checks the encrypted activity journal does not contain plaintext policyDecisionId.
- Broad app/game package blocking, AppLocker, App Control, install blocking, and launch allowlists remain not-claimed/manual-required.
